      "body": "Windows-compatible fork of the complete carvalab/pi-zgrep 0.3.0 package and history.\n\nAll four search modes, query filters, preview/refresh, slash commands and completions, automatic indexing, daemon reuse, binary resolution, installation fallbacks, and environment opt-outs are retained.\n\nFixes cover Windows process/shim and daemon launching, quoted roots and valued index arguments, filenames with spaces/drive letters, explicit query errors, stderr progress, current-call cancellation, and empty-result parsing.\n\nIncludes an English workspace-search skill and the local Pi integration/profile changes. Details: WINDOWS.md.\n\nValidated on Windows x64, Node 26.1.0, Pi 1.0.0 and zvec-grep 0.2.2: lint, formatting, type checks, 62 regression tests, two real-engine E2E tests, 13 isolated Pi SDK checks, and the installed Pi tool/skill/profile configuration. No model-inference requests were made by these checks.\n\nInstall: pi install git:github.com/rodrigojager/pi-zgrep@v0.3.1-rodrigo.1\n\nThis fork is distributed on GitHub; npm publication is disabled."
    }
